#lang rmn/v2
(map
  ("type" "Phase2TerritoryConformanceLaw")
  ("version" 1)
  ("precondition" "A customer names one bounded territory beneath the provider's explicitly granted material root. The provider publishes the exact closed ruleset identity, sovereign circuit interface, and ERC-4337 account.")
  ("operation" "Observe every nonexcluded live textual carrier in deterministic path order; apply the content-addressed closed conformance rules with their exact scopes; retain no customer bytes; and write only the resulting typed receipt through the hired witness-journal RDF provider.")
  ("postcondition" "Return one canonical RMN report binding the ruleset, exact observed territory, every rule/path/line violation, aggregate counts, and the Boolean conformance judgment. The report certifies only this bounded observation and does not amend, waive, or repair any violation.")
  ("refusal" "Refuse an absent or escaping territory, symbolic-link territory root, changed or unknown ruleset, unreadable material, oversized text interpreted as scanned, ignored live code, compatibility exception, customer mutation, provider-local JSONL, absent witness journal provider, noncanonical RMN, or any judgment without exact observation inputs, attribution, result, and replay material. Producer identity neither proves nor disproves correctness."))
